GitHub Pages Jekyll chalata hai, aur Jekyll dot se shuru hone wale folder
chhod deta hai. Iska matlab /.well-known/assetlinks.json kabhi serve nahi
hota — aur usi file se Android ko pata chalta hai ki app aur website ek hi
maalik ke hain. Wo na mile to TWA app ke upar browser wala URL bar dikhta
rehta hai.

Ye khali file Jekyll ko band kar deti hai. Ise hataana mat.
